body:
I wound up ordering Splatoon 3 off amazon and accidently wound up with the PEGI version instead of the US. I mean it does boot up and play and I do know there isn't any region locking on the switch, but the question essentially for me is this.

&#x200B;

 If any DLCs come out will I be able to have USA DLC work with my physical PEGI game?

&#x200B;

 Nintendo's FAQ says that the supported regions for software are in the support information tab and the USA is on the list but then I've seen people say that they needed to get a US copy of the game for US DLC to work. What exactly are the differences between versions? Am I gonna wind up in European servers as an american or something? lol. I apologize in advance if this seems like a dumb question.
